WEBVTT

00:09.700 --> 00:11.410
My body is feeling better than expected.

00:14.040 --> 00:15.580
Good morning.

00:15.580 --> 00:16.910
Nephrites?!

00:16.910 --> 00:18.700
When did you get here?

00:18.700 --> 00:20.410
I was here the whole time.

00:20.410 --> 00:21.380
The whole time?!

00:22.160 --> 00:23.840
How are you feeling?

00:25.290 --> 00:30.130
The ring has the power
to heal any injury.

00:30.830 --> 00:33.040
You've been training so hard

00:33.040 --> 00:34.840
so you can defeat Princess Granart.

00:35.330 --> 00:39.350
You can put it that way.
I'm only doing my best.

00:40.120 --> 00:43.080
But honestly,
I'll probably end up losing.

00:43.950 --> 00:45.900
With the ring's power,

00:46.200 --> 00:47.610
you can win.

00:49.620 --> 00:50.570
Of course,

00:50.570 --> 00:54.620
it's best to have the princess' recognition.

00:55.290 --> 00:57.410
But the Ring King's mission

00:57.410 --> 01:00.540
is to collect all the rings.

01:01.080 --> 01:03.670
For that, you must use
any means necessary.

01:04.040 --> 01:07.010
Well... I'm aware of that...

01:08.820 --> 01:13.370
The Ring Princess' duty
is to assist the Ring King.

01:14.540 --> 01:18.810
Lord Satou, just follow your heart
and do what you think is necessary.

01:22.200 --> 01:23.140
You are right.

01:24.750 --> 01:26.820
Thank you, Nephrites.

01:32.410 --> 01:34.780
I should try a little harder.

01:43.040 --> 01:45.890
When I finally mustered my courage...

01:56.470 --> 02:04.350
TALES OF WEDDING RINGS

03:27.410 --> 03:28.860
Whoa...

03:30.500 --> 03:32.220
You've improved a lot.

03:32.220 --> 03:33.950
Does it mean I can win?

03:33.950 --> 03:35.490
At least once out of ten tries?

03:35.490 --> 03:37.860
That's not possible.

03:38.280 --> 03:39.820
I knew it.

03:40.700 --> 03:45.320
Your opponent isn't going to use
these obvious attacks like I did just now.

03:45.870 --> 03:47.700
When you can counter that

03:47.700 --> 03:50.130
and still pull off your moves earlier,

03:51.620 --> 03:53.870
you might stand a chance.

03:54.830 --> 03:57.540
Well, at least you can win once

03:57.540 --> 03:59.180
out of ten thousand tries.

03:59.790 --> 04:01.540
With the power from your rings,

04:01.540 --> 04:03.180
she shouldn't be a problem.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.730
Then, please once more!

04:09.540 --> 04:11.360
Is that the Ring King?

04:11.830 --> 04:14.940
They said Princess Granart
has high expectations for him.

04:15.330 --> 04:18.070
She even let him touch her body.

04:19.579 --> 04:21.700
What do you mean by that?!

04:28.200 --> 04:30.290
She let him touch her body

04:30.290 --> 04:32.580
so he could scrub her, huh?

04:33.340 --> 04:34.460
But...

04:35.870 --> 04:39.930
That doesn't change the fact
that Satou touched her.

04:41.000 --> 04:44.970
The body of that princess...

04:47.290 --> 04:48.880
No!

04:49.700 --> 04:54.430
But I can't say that either to him...

04:56.950 --> 04:59.200
The Ring King is
having a rematch with her?

04:59.510 --> 05:01.410
We don't get this kind of fight every day.

05:02.180 --> 05:03.370
Ouch...

05:04.080 --> 05:05.780
She's insanely powerful.

05:07.830 --> 05:09.080
Ring King!

05:09.080 --> 05:10.290
Princess!

05:11.620 --> 05:13.250
- Ring King! Go for it!
- Princess Granart!

05:13.250 --> 05:17.240
Satou! Give it your best!

05:18.790 --> 05:20.580
What's the matter, Krystal?

05:20.580 --> 05:22.750
Aren't you going to cheer for him?

05:22.750 --> 05:28.380
Satou has been training really hard lately
to earn Princess Granart's recognition.

05:30.540 --> 05:32.520
Does that even matter?

05:33.120 --> 05:35.280
His job is to collect
rings from princesses

05:35.660 --> 05:38.140
other than myself.

05:41.540 --> 05:45.030
Just when I thought I might have
the chance to become a king...

05:45.330 --> 05:48.790
Ring King, show us what you've got!

05:48.790 --> 05:50.410
That's not fair.

05:50.410 --> 05:53.500
He gets stronger with his ring.

05:58.060 --> 05:59.120
A ring?

06:00.290 --> 06:02.680
Take me...

06:03.210 --> 06:04.860
...if you desire more power.

06:07.870 --> 06:11.100
Take my power.

06:19.580 --> 06:21.190
So you're not changing your mind?

06:21.500 --> 06:22.530
Yes.

06:22.950 --> 06:26.130
I'll make you acknowledge my strength!

06:27.450 --> 06:29.700
Hey, what are you doing?

06:30.370 --> 06:31.790
Leave now!

06:31.790 --> 06:33.620
Come another time if you want a rematch.

06:33.620 --> 06:34.660
Silence!

06:35.910 --> 06:37.220
Ring King.

06:37.220 --> 06:39.630
You robbed me of my chance back in Lomka.

06:41.540 --> 06:43.670
I won't allow it to happen again!

06:44.630 --> 06:46.010
Ring King, dodge!

07:08.270 --> 07:10.240
Abyssal Creatures!

07:12.540 --> 07:15.510
That guy summoned the Abyssal Creatures!

07:18.050 --> 07:19.590
Fire monsters?

07:19.590 --> 07:21.750
Stand back, Your Highness!

07:26.000 --> 07:30.040
The catfolks have been
training night and day

07:30.040 --> 07:32.000
for the resurrection of the Abyss King

07:32.000 --> 07:34.470
after he was defeated.

07:34.470 --> 07:38.400
His forces are nothing to be scared of!

07:38.910 --> 07:41.500
Separate this zone from the others.

07:41.500 --> 07:44.250
We must keep the monsters here.

07:44.250 --> 07:44.780
Yes!

07:45.370 --> 07:46.160
Run!

07:46.160 --> 07:48.200
Leave this area and find shelter!

07:48.200 --> 07:49.370
Decouple the link now!

07:49.370 --> 07:50.070
Yes!

07:53.730 --> 07:55.500
It's time for the catfolks...

07:55.890 --> 07:58.100
...to show their might!

07:58.790 --> 08:00.870
Knight of the Abyss King, huh?

08:00.870 --> 08:02.580
I've heard rumors about it.

08:02.580 --> 08:05.670
It should be my worthy opponent.

08:06.000 --> 08:09.390
I've been so bored after fighting
the weak for so long.

08:11.250 --> 08:12.050
Granart!

08:12.330 --> 08:14.140
Watch and learn!

08:19.500 --> 08:22.360
I need to figure out a way
to deal with that flame.

08:25.190 --> 08:26.870
All right. This should work.

08:26.870 --> 08:28.150
Wind magic!

08:38.620 --> 08:39.919
Ouch...

08:40.909 --> 08:44.150
I thought the wind was strong enough
to put out the flame.

08:45.230 --> 08:47.160
I'll take care of it here.

08:47.160 --> 08:48.250
Don't be silly.

08:48.250 --> 08:51.220
Your sword can't even cut that thing.

08:51.660 --> 08:52.550
Indeed.

08:53.120 --> 08:55.680
But I'm not going to give up just yet.

08:58.260 --> 08:59.910
My people...

08:59.910 --> 09:03.610
...are descendants of the warriors
who fought alongside the Ring King.

09:04.080 --> 09:07.030
Since you are the Ring King
of this generation,

09:07.450 --> 09:08.700
fighting by your side

09:08.700 --> 09:10.490
and protecting you until the very end

09:10.490 --> 09:12.080
is our duty.

09:13.330 --> 09:16.160
It doesn't matter how unreliable you are.

09:20.660 --> 09:22.070
Gramps says...

09:22.450 --> 09:26.140
I haven't even mastered
the ring's magic yet.

09:26.950 --> 09:27.800
But...

09:28.540 --> 09:31.110
If I can distract that thing

09:31.490 --> 09:33.930
and disperse its flame...

09:34.370 --> 09:35.380
It's too risky.

09:35.950 --> 09:38.720
I'm a total wimp compared to you, Granart.

09:39.040 --> 09:43.520
But there is something I can do!

09:45.660 --> 09:46.730
I get it.

09:47.790 --> 09:48.620
Very well.

09:51.980 --> 09:53.780
The rings are here!

09:54.450 --> 09:55.990
Come and get them!

09:55.990 --> 09:57.700
The rings...

10:00.620 --> 10:01.450
Not yet.

10:02.580 --> 10:03.420
Closer...

10:04.580 --> 10:06.020
Just a bit closer...!

10:07.080 --> 10:07.880
Now!

10:18.180 --> 10:19.390
Granart!

10:19.390 --> 10:20.640
I got this!

10:26.250 --> 10:27.700
Ring King, finish it!

10:49.410 --> 10:52.460
Was the knight being controlled
by the black ring?

10:53.290 --> 10:54.840
Princess Granart!

10:57.330 --> 11:00.040
We took out all the monsters.

11:00.040 --> 11:00.930
Well done.

11:01.580 --> 11:02.790
Is everyone all right?

11:02.790 --> 11:03.750
Yeah.

11:03.750 --> 11:06.370
The catfolks sure are strong.

11:06.370 --> 11:09.060
Huh? What happened to me?

11:15.910 --> 11:17.090
Ring King.

11:18.250 --> 11:21.850
It seems I underestimated you.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.540
You may lack the strength,

11:25.250 --> 11:27.570
but you possess the qualities of a king.

11:28.700 --> 11:30.370
I acknowledge your worth.

11:32.160 --> 11:33.800
You may become my husband.

11:37.410 --> 11:39.050
It can't be helped.

11:39.520 --> 11:42.000
This is the very reason why
Satou is working so hard.

11:43.370 --> 11:46.350
No. Not yet.

11:47.700 --> 11:49.520
I don't ask for your recognition.

11:50.290 --> 11:51.830
I'm going to make you recognize me.

11:52.660 --> 11:53.660
Granart.

11:54.120 --> 11:57.580
I'm challenging you to another fight.

12:01.450 --> 12:03.110
Let me confirm once again.

12:03.540 --> 12:06.210
The fight is over when one of us

12:06.480 --> 12:08.170
is unable to battle.

12:09.170 --> 12:10.210
Brace yourself!

12:14.050 --> 12:15.160
From the right...

12:17.130 --> 12:18.510
It came from the left!

12:19.450 --> 12:21.220
Satou, calm down!

12:22.410 --> 12:23.970
It's not over yet.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.650
Why are you even doing this?

12:27.580 --> 12:29.620
She's already agreed to give you the ring.

12:29.620 --> 12:30.550
You're such a fool.

12:31.700 --> 12:34.360
Princess Krystal, won't you cheer for him?

12:36.330 --> 12:41.290
Lord Satou is fighting for your sake.

12:44.330 --> 12:46.750
For me?

12:48.040 --> 12:50.210
Use the rings.

12:50.500 --> 12:53.540
Are you going easy on me?

12:53.540 --> 12:54.550
No.

12:55.290 --> 12:58.120
The rings are power
I'm borrowing from Hime and Nephrites.

12:58.750 --> 12:59.940
It's not my own power.

13:01.120 --> 13:02.510
Even if it helped me win,

13:02.510 --> 13:07.580
I'm still the pathetic man who's lost
in front of the girl he likes.

13:08.330 --> 13:11.550
I'm trying to be the cool guy...

13:11.550 --> 13:13.650
...for the wife I love!

13:16.620 --> 13:17.870
He really is

13:18.620 --> 13:20.120
a big oaf.

13:20.570 --> 13:22.780
Satou!

13:23.120 --> 13:25.500
If you defeat Granart,

13:25.500 --> 13:28.500
I'll have sex with you as your reward!

13:35.260 --> 13:36.430
Yeah!

13:41.580 --> 13:43.050
How amusing.

13:43.580 --> 13:45.900
You are an amusing man.

13:46.330 --> 13:48.280
I'll assist you in this fight.

13:48.280 --> 13:50.890
This voice is coming from the ring.

13:51.700 --> 13:55.500
I'll see through her next move.

13:56.410 --> 13:58.540
Focus on my voice.

13:59.200 --> 14:02.470
Doing so will let you act faster
than her in a split second.

14:02.470 --> 14:04.030
But that's...

14:04.380 --> 14:05.540
Don't worry.

14:06.060 --> 14:08.380
This isn't the power
of the Ring Princesses.

14:09.200 --> 14:12.370
Consider this an opportunity
you've earned yourself.

14:12.750 --> 14:14.660
I don't get it,
but I know what to do.

14:15.370 --> 14:16.460
Very well.

14:19.580 --> 14:20.620
What's wrong?

14:21.040 --> 14:24.380
Are you shocked by her cheer?

14:24.750 --> 14:25.840
Brace yourself!

14:29.060 --> 14:30.410
She disappeared!

14:30.410 --> 14:31.380
Above you.

14:34.580 --> 14:35.600
What?!

14:51.160 --> 14:52.830
Satou!

14:52.830 --> 14:53.960
He did it!

14:54.290 --> 14:56.400
Lord Satou is amazing!

14:56.830 --> 14:58.260
He actually won...

15:00.120 --> 15:02.680
What was that just now?

15:14.670 --> 15:15.350
What...

15:21.330 --> 15:23.380
Great work, Ring King.

15:23.830 --> 15:27.080
You're the first to have defeated me.

15:27.790 --> 15:31.710
I must give you the recognition you deserve.

15:33.750 --> 15:36.460
All right. Let's make a baby.

15:39.250 --> 15:40.660
In Needakitta,

15:40.660 --> 15:42.860
the winner has the utmost respect.

15:43.450 --> 15:46.630
The defeated must
serve the winner wholeheartedly.

15:46.630 --> 15:48.260
Hold on...!

15:48.790 --> 15:51.310
I'll ask my servant to get things ready.

15:51.930 --> 15:52.640
Wait.

15:55.980 --> 15:58.080
Why should we wait?

15:58.080 --> 16:00.440
I'm already your wife.

16:00.440 --> 16:04.920
Are you saying my body
isn't good enough for you?

16:05.700 --> 16:06.820
No.

16:07.580 --> 16:09.990
I already have a promise
with someone else.

16:12.500 --> 16:15.100
Hime and I made a promise.

16:24.400 --> 16:27.500
Satou, you did great.

16:27.500 --> 16:30.180
And this is your reward, after all.

16:31.020 --> 16:35.930
We are a couple anyway.
It's something we normally do.

16:39.080 --> 16:41.560
Hime. Can we...

16:41.560 --> 16:42.940
Satou?

16:43.250 --> 16:45.080
...get down to business?

16:50.150 --> 16:54.700
I'm going to let him have his way with me.

16:56.800 --> 16:58.140
All right, Satou.

16:58.140 --> 16:59.660
Let's do it.

17:03.670 --> 17:04.670
Satou?

17:08.700 --> 17:11.290
Hime's boobs...

17:14.550 --> 17:15.890
I see.

17:16.410 --> 17:18.410
He used the rings' power

17:19.160 --> 17:21.250
and fought so hard.

17:24.250 --> 17:27.540
You looked cool today, Satou.

17:41.700 --> 17:42.750
Good morning.

17:45.410 --> 17:46.340
My darling.

17:49.290 --> 17:51.000
When did I fall asleep?

17:53.160 --> 17:55.890
You were so feisty last night, Satou.

17:56.160 --> 17:57.200
What...

17:57.910 --> 17:59.450
I don't remember a thing...

18:02.290 --> 18:04.950
Nothing happened last night.

18:04.950 --> 18:06.160
Nephrites!?

18:07.540 --> 18:10.440
I was awake and watching the whole time.

18:11.040 --> 18:13.040
After all, it's my turn next.

18:13.040 --> 18:13.910
Your turn?!

18:14.180 --> 18:16.540
After her, it's my turn!

18:16.540 --> 18:18.120
Granart was here too?

18:18.390 --> 18:20.970
Princess Granart, it's time.

18:20.970 --> 18:21.830
All right.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.360
You should be there too.

18:24.660 --> 18:26.500
We are holding a wedding party.

18:34.120 --> 18:36.220
The people of Needakitta

18:36.500 --> 18:38.910
have returned to the Ring King

18:38.910 --> 18:41.520
and become his fellow warriors once again!

18:44.460 --> 18:47.410
She finally found the right man.

18:47.410 --> 18:50.520
I was worried
she'd never find a good suitor.

18:51.950 --> 18:52.920
Ring King.

18:53.540 --> 18:55.780
You said you wanted
to earn my recognition.

18:57.330 --> 18:59.450
I'm glad you said it.

19:02.330 --> 19:03.450
Umm...

19:03.450 --> 19:04.460
I know.

19:05.130 --> 19:09.000
You read my movement perfectly.

19:09.500 --> 19:11.080
It wasn't a coincidence.

19:11.080 --> 19:13.860
That was something else.

19:14.750 --> 19:19.390
Your victory is the result
of your determination.

19:19.820 --> 19:23.200
That's all that I need.

19:38.910 --> 19:40.740
Hime!

19:43.620 --> 19:45.440
Why did you gulp down the whole cup?

19:46.290 --> 19:48.090
How should I know?

19:51.180 --> 19:52.550
Satou.

19:53.150 --> 19:57.510
Stop making me worry.

20:00.990 --> 20:04.900
I was really happy at that moment.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.950
You cheered for me.

20:08.870 --> 20:13.080
But I want to finish that thing with you

20:13.080 --> 20:15.690
after I'm back in my world.

20:17.950 --> 20:21.170
This world is too unusual for me.

20:21.700 --> 20:23.750
If we are to develop this relationship,

20:23.750 --> 20:27.120
I want us to carry on in my world.

20:27.500 --> 20:28.670
Satou...

20:29.500 --> 20:31.120
I don't think it's right

20:31.120 --> 20:35.000
to use this as a substitute
or a means to love.

20:36.830 --> 20:38.450
Thanks.

20:38.450 --> 20:40.560
It's a relief to hear that.

20:41.750 --> 20:42.530
However...

20:43.270 --> 20:48.370
I still want to reward you
for your hard work.

20:49.950 --> 20:51.890
Is there anything you want to do

20:51.890 --> 20:52.900
or want me to do?

20:54.000 --> 20:56.720
I can grant you one wish.

21:01.370 --> 21:03.540
I want...

21:05.080 --> 21:07.160
I want to touch your boobs.

21:08.620 --> 21:12.500
I want to touch your boobs
to my heart's content!

21:15.160 --> 21:18.040
I-I guess it can't be helped.

21:18.040 --> 21:20.250
Satou, you're a perv.

21:20.250 --> 21:21.700
Can I?

21:21.700 --> 21:22.830
Fine. Go ahead.

21:34.040 --> 21:35.250
Granart!

21:35.250 --> 21:36.360
Nephrites!

21:36.360 --> 21:38.740
I can't stand it anymore!

21:41.410 --> 21:43.290
I'm already 18 years old.

21:43.290 --> 21:46.870
Most of my people
get married before that age.

21:46.870 --> 21:50.080
- Stop making me wait.
- Princess Krystal, look at that.

21:50.450 --> 21:51.830
Cat powder?!

21:51.830 --> 21:54.660
I don't mind how we do it
as long as we do it.

22:03.250 --> 22:09.330
That is how the Ring King
still remains a virgin.
